/* 区域探索事件库 卷2 / 机括城·修道院·温室庄园 / 零编号命名 */
:: MP Region Clockwork CoolingTowerTube [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
蒸汽压力室西侧的副冷却塔排污口卡着一只防水铜筒，四周笼罩着淡淡的白雾。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
你旋开排污口的卡箍，铜筒里卷着一张被蒸汽熏软的管线图，筒底还有几枚铜垫片。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拔排污口防水铜筒 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[拆开铜筒底盖 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 291>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_clockwork_coolingtowertube_reward")>><<money 518>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_clockwork_coolingtowertube")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回冷却塔外 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Clockwork BrokenGaugeTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
压力室仪表墙的第八块圆形温度计玻璃碎了，表盘后面塞着一只扁平的锡烟盒。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
你从碎表盘后抽出烟盒，盒里没有烟，只有几枚旧币和一张记着压力的纸片。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[抽出表盘烟盒 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[掰开烟盒内衬 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 274>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_clockwork_brokengaugetin_reward")>><<money 442>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_clockwork_brokengaugetin")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退出仪表墙 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Clockwork QuartzSandSundial [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
停摆天文台南侧的星象沙盘里铺着银白色石英砂，沙层下埋着一枚青铜日晷。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.isFreezing>>微凉水雾在青铜日晷表面结了薄霜。<<else>>空气里带着微温。<</if>>
你拨开石英砂，日晷晷针还能转动，底座刻着一圈被沙磨浅的刻度。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拨开沙层看日晷 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[旋动日晷晷针 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 263>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_clockwork_quartzsandsundial_reward")>><<money 816>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_clockwork_quartzsandsundial")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退出星象沙盘 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Clockwork CometChartWax [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
天文台观测椅扶手下方的黄铜记录板夹着一叠手绘彗星轨迹图，末页用红蜡封着。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
你剥开末页红蜡，蜡下压着一小片写有彗星周期的薄铜片。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[剥开彗星图红蜡 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 7>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[抽出蜡下铜片 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 243>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_clockwork_cometchartwax_reward")>><<money 764>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_clockwork_cometchartwax")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退出天文台座椅 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Clockwork HalfOpenSafe12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
档案馆密库东侧的保险柜群中，唯有第十二号黑铁柜的转盘锁停在半开位置。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
你拉开半开的柜门，转盘锁后还卡着一小截铁丝，柜内抽屉没有锁。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拉开黑铁柜门 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[拨开转盘后铁丝 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_clockwork_halfopensafe12_reward")>><<money 790>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_clockwork_halfopensafe12")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>
